<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sees state debt at 78.1 pct of GDP in '96.</title>
<headline>Sweden sees state debt at 78.1 pct of GDP in '96.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish government on Friday said it saw gross state debt at 78.1 percent of gross domestic product (GDP) in 1996 and 78.0 percent in 1997.  </p>
<p>The figure was forecast to then fall further, to 74.8 percent in 1998 and 70.8 percent in 1999.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
